WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.020 --> 00:00:00.520
Hello.

00:00:00.880 --> 00:00:07.760
I, uh wanted to make a statement on what I said in my previous live-stream

00:00:08.020 --> 00:00:10.540
You probably won't believe me when I say this,

00:00:10.540 --> 00:00:14.200
but whenever I go online and I hear other players

00:00:14.200 --> 00:00:16.520
use the same kind of language that I did,

00:00:16.520 --> 00:00:21.520
I always find it extremely immature and stupid and

00:00:21.520 --> 00:00:26.700
I hate how I now personally fed
into that part of gaming as well.

00:00:26.700 --> 00:00:29.980
It was something that I said in
the heat of the moment.

00:00:29.980 --> 00:00:32.960
I said the worst word I could possibly think of.

00:00:32.960 --> 00:00:35.600
And it just sort of slipped out.

00:00:35.600 --> 00:00:38.820
And I'm not gonna make any excuses as to why it did

00:00:38.820 --> 00:00:41.080
Because there are no excuses for it.

00:00:41.080 --> 00:00:43.720
I'm disappointed in myself because It seems like

00:00:43.720 --> 00:00:46.380
I've learned nothing from all these past controversies.

00:00:46.380 --> 00:00:51.240
And it's not that i think I can say or do
whatever I want and get away with it.

00:00:51.240 --> 00:00:52.820
That's not it at all.

00:00:52.820 --> 00:00:53.960
I'm just an idiot.

00:00:53.960 --> 00:00:58.500
But that doesn't make what I said or how I said it okay

00:00:58.500 --> 00:00:59.600
It was not okay.

00:00:59.600 --> 00:01:05.520
I'm really sorry if I offended, hurt or
disappointed anyone with all of this.

00:01:05.520 --> 00:01:08.300
Being in the position I am, I should know better.

00:01:08.300 --> 00:01:10.740
I know I can't keep messing up like this.

00:01:10.740 --> 00:01:15.520
And I owe it to my audience and
to myself to do better than this

00:01:15.520 --> 00:01:17.720
because I know I'm better than this.

00:01:17.720 --> 00:01:20.940
I really want to improve myself and better myself

00:01:20.940 --> 00:01:25.260
Not just for me, but for anyone that looks up to me.

00:01:25.260 --> 00:01:27.260
Or anyone that's influenced by me.

00:01:27.260 --> 00:01:30.620
And that's how I want to move forward away from this.

00:01:31.140 --> 00:01:34.880
That's all I had to say. Thank you for watching. Bye.

